#: ../../genrst/index.rst:6
msgid "OpenMV MicroPython differences from CPython"
msgstr "Perbedaan OpenMV MicroPython dari CPython"

#: ../../genrst/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"MicroPython implements Python 3.4 and some select features of Python 3.5 and"
" above.  The sections below describe the current status of these features."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython mengimplementasikan Python 3.4 dan beberapa fitur pilihan dari "
"Python 3.5 ke atas. Bagian-bagian di bawah ini menjelaskan status terkini "
"fitur-fitur tersebut."

#: ../../genrst/index.rst:20
msgid ""
"For the features of Python that are implemented by MicroPython, there are "
"sometimes differences in their behaviour compared to standard Python.  The "
"operations listed in the sections below produce conflicting results in "
"MicroPython when compared to standard Python."
msgstr ""
"Untuk fitur-fitur Python yang diimplementasikan oleh MicroPython, terkadang "
"ada perbedaan perilaku dibandingkan dengan Python standar. Operasi yang "
"tercantum dalam bagian di bawah ini menghasilkan hasil yang bertentangan di "
"MicroPython jika dibandingkan dengan Python standar."
